{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"mukul975--anthropic-cybersecurity-skills--detecting-container-escape-with-falco-rules","name":"detecting-container-escape-with-falco-rules","description":"Writes and tunes Falco rule syntax for container escape detection - conditions, macros, lists, priorities, and output fields - covering host filesystem mounts, sensitive host path access, kernel module loading, and privileged capability abuse, including how to drive down false positives. Use when authoring or tuning a specific Falco rule for breakout behaviour, or triaging a noisy escape-related Falco alert. Keywords: Falco rule, macro, list, condition, priority, falco_rules.local.yaml, tuning, false positive. Do not use for deploying and operating Falco itself - use detecting-container-runtime-threats-with-falco; for tool-agnostic escape signals use detecting-container-escape-attempts.","category":"Cloud & DevOps","tags":["detecting","container","escape","falco","rules","writes","tunes","rule","syntax","detection","conditions","macros","lists","priorities","output","fields","covering","host"],"repo":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","owner":"mukul975","stars":34277,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"Apache-2.0","licensePath":"skills/detecting-container-escape-with-falco-rules/LICENSE","revision":"54a798831d2266a3ca61ce68a7acb80b81160d57","path":"skills/detecting-container-escape-with-falco-rules","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills/tree/54a798831d2266a3ca61ce68a7acb80b81160d57/skills/detecting-container-escape-with-falco-rules","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:14:06.196Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-31T04:32:42Z","fileCount":8,"bytes":46871,"sha256":"e9d473cd10641221e3edcfbf1fca42779266ae710ee63b05727a7937c1aecac0","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"LICENSE","sourcePath":"skills/detecting-container-escape-with-falco-rules/LICENSE","bytes":11255,"sha256":"a941b58ef0ba43a31e24ae7ece1b743a585efed9e37792b9ca063e0798be1cbe","mode":420,"url":